{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2096","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"H. Wonderful XOR Problem"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are the proud... never mind, just solve this problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$n$$$ intervals $$$[l_1, r_1], [l_2, r_2], \\ldots [l_n, r_n]$$$. For each $$$x$$$ from $$$0$$$ to $$$2^m - 1$$$, find the number, modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$, of sequences $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots a_n$$$ such that:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$l_i \\leq a_i \\leq r_i$$$ for all $$$i$$$ from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_1 \\oplus a_2 \\oplus \\ldots \\oplus a_n = x$$$, where $$$\\oplus$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise XOR operator"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$1 \\leq m \\leq 18$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th of the next $$$n$$$ lines contains two integers $$$l_i$$$ and $$$r_i$$$ ($$$0 \\leq l_i \\leq r_i \\lt 2^m$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$, and the sum of $$$2^m$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2^{18}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each $$$x$$$ from $$$0$$$ to $$$2^m - 1$$$, let:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_x$$$ be the number of valid sequences, modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$g_x = f_x \\cdot 2^x \\mod 998\\,244\\,353$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here, $$$f_x$$$ and $$$g_x$$$ are both integers in the interval $$$[0, 998\\,244\\,352]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let $$$h = g_0 \\oplus g_1 \\oplus \\ldots \\oplus g_{2^m - 1}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer — the value of $$$h$$$ itself. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Do not"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" perform a modulo operation. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n2 2\n0 2\n1 3\n5 3\n3 7\n1 3\n0 2\n1 5\n3 6\n10 14\n314 1592\n653 5897\n932 3846\n264 3383\n279 5028\n841 9716\n939 9375\n105 8209\n749 4459\n230 7816\n1 5\n0 29\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n22\n9812\n75032210\n1073741823\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first test case, the values of $$$f_x$$$ are as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_0 = 2$$$, because there are $$$2$$$ valid sequences: $$$[1, 1]$$$ and $$$[2, 2]$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_1 = 2$$$, because there are $$$2$$$ valid sequences: $$$[0, 1]$$$ and $$$[2, 3]$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_2 = 2$$$, because there are $$$2$$$ valid sequences: $$$[0, 2]$$$ and $$$[1, 3]$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_3 = 3$$$, because there are $$$3$$$ valid sequences: $$$[0, 3]$$$, $$$[1, 2]$$$, and $$$[2, 1]$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The values of $$$g_x$$$ are as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$g_0 = f_0 \\cdot 2^0 = 2 \\cdot 2^0 = 2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$g_1 = f_1 \\cdot 2^1 = 2 \\cdot 2^1 = 4$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$g_2 = f_2 \\cdot 2^2 = 2 \\cdot 2^2 = 8$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$g_3 = f_3 \\cdot 2^3 = 3 \\cdot 2^3 = 24$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Thus, the value to output is $$$2 \\oplus 4 \\oplus 8 \\oplus 24 = 22$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second test case, the values of $$$f_x$$$ are as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_{0} = 120$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_{1} = 120$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_{2} = 119$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_{3} = 118$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_{4} = 105$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_{5} = 105$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_{6} = 106$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f_{7} = 107$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"H","problemCode":"2096H","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2096/problem/H"}